        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game supports one-click mod installation.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(Requires accessing a third-party website via a one-click link for download)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins in a castle occupied by demons.The goddesses are imprisoned here...Our protagonist, PaiPai, wakes up in the demons' prison.She needs to escape from here and end the demons' control over the goddesses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that combines high-density enemy groups, side-scrolling action-adventure, and dungeon exploration.It is also an arcade-style game where the same levels can be replayed repeatedly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a total of 5 levels, and you will face a huge number of enemies!Choosing a reasonable way to eliminate them is a very important strategy~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initially, you have 3 abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shock Wave: This skill is not very stable! But it can be continuously upgraded to increase attack power and attack range!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blink: You can blink at any time to avoid damage and reach some hard-to-access places! However, Blink has a cooldown time and cannot be used multiple times in a short period!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight: The most important skill in the game! You can activate Light Shield while flying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gold coins you obtain in the game can be used to unlock and upgrade magic~You can attack the loot dropped by enemies to get more gold coins~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 types of magic in the game waiting for you to unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice Surge: Extremely fast firing speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire Surge: Wide attack range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantum Barrage: Strong penetration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light Shield: It can not only act as a shield to protect you! It can also instantly kill enemies! Using it reasonably can deal high damage to bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, let's unite together~! Let's help our protagonist escape from here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the lovely voice actors~<br>Naoka Nakayama 中山尚華</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ona Fujita  藤田伊緒奈</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rio Tokura 柚木提娜</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manoa Ueda 上田真乃彩</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reika Morimoto    森本丽香</p>",
