ge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quantum Barrage: Strong penetration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light Shield: It can not only act as a shield to protect you! It can also instantly kill enemies! Using it reasonably can deal high damage to bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, let's unite together~! Let's help our protagonist escape from here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the lovely voice actors~<br>Naoka Nakayama 中山尚華</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ona Fujita  藤田伊緒奈</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rio Tokura 柚木提娜</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manoa Ueda 上田真乃彩</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reika Morimoto    森本丽香</p>",
